WEBVTT

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.588
What could Mr. Shindo be thinking?

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.090
It's been three days now.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.553
Shuichi probably still can't
recover from the shock of it.

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:13.055
I'm sure.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.600
What with a plan to have Mr. Yuki
provide lyrics to Nittle Grasper...

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.560
...secretly in the works.

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:20.771
That has nothing to do
with what's going on here.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:24.066
Shuichi has yet to finish
the lyrics for the next CD.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.484
At this rate,

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:28.320
there's a serious possibility that
its release could be postponed.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.571
Isn't that right?

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.323
Since it's come to this,

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:35.035
it looks like we've got no choice but
to tell him to apologize to Shuichi.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:36.078
Tell who?

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.412
Who else?!

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:42.584
M-Mr. Yuki?

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:47.297
Did Shuichi Shindo come here?

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.340
What?

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:51.468
Is something the matter with Shindo?

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.304
| am aoing home.
Shuichi

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:55.764
"I am..."

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.099
"...going home?"

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:01.520
So, he's not here.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.243
Blind Game Again

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:19.580
A pretty crazed doll
kanari kireteru doll

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:25.919
Demolish the never-changing night
itsumademo kawaranai yoru o buchikowase

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:34.553
The light searching in the rustling breeze
zawameku kaze ni meguru raito ga

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:39.141
Makes a noise, scattering my memory
oto o tatete kioku o tobasu

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:46.189
A temptation I really should know
kitto shiranu hazu mo nai yuuwaku

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:53.238
Don't Let Me Down

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:57.075
I'm always just trying to please
itsumo kobiteru dake

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:58.827
Cry For the Sun

00:01:58.869 --> 00:02:02.789
I can't see anything
nanimo rote ya shinai

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:08.295
Who is it that cries out inside me?
jibun no naka de dare ga sakebu

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:11.256
Blind Game Again

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:14.551
A pretty classy doll
kanari kimeteru doll

00:02:14.593 --> 00:02:20.766
If it's a dream you can't reach, just toss it aside
todokanai yume nara isso nugisutero

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.517
Drastic Game Again

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:25.854
A pretty crazed doll
kanari kireteru doll

00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:32.235
Demolish the never-changing night
itsumademo kawaranai yoru o buchikowase

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:46.875
Wait up.

00:02:48.627 --> 00:02:52.047
Won't you... please go get him for us?

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:54.299
None of us will do.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.886
He loves you from the
bottom of his heart,

00:02:58.178 --> 00:02:59.846
and he won't come back unless it's you.

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:00.931
So, please!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:02.974
And he just leaves!
And he just leaves!

00:03:02.974 --> 00:03:04.101
All right!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.062
I'll bring him back!

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:08.480
How?
How?

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:11.358
Put a rope around his neck,
and hang him till he passes out,

00:03:11.358 --> 00:03:13.610
throw a couple good American
punches into him, and then...

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.613
Using the bubble wrap I have
fun popping in my free time,

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:18.657
I'll roll him up!

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:22.619
Something's just not right here.
Something's just not right here.

00:03:44.558 --> 00:03:46.101
Big brother!

00:03:46.268 --> 00:03:46.893
It's noon! It's the middle of the day!

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:49.646
Apsolutely do not enter. Shuichi
It's noon! It's the middle of the day!

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:50.313
Apsolutely do not enter.
Shuichi

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:53.859
And no response. Honestly!

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:58.572
Here I thought he came home for once,
but now he won't come out of his room.

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.367
I'll leave your meal here, okay?

00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:05.203
And no response yet again.

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:17.507
There we go.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:18.800
Okay.

00:04:22.471 --> 00:04:25.140
Sheesh, I wonder what's gotten into...

00:04:40.322 --> 00:04:43.116
| wonder what's gotten into big brother?

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.616
Huh?

00:05:25.075 --> 00:05:27.327
Hey, hey! What are you doing?!

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.376
What? Um, well...

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:38.129
I need to speak with you.

00:05:40.257 --> 00:05:41.758
Eiri...

00:05:45.637 --> 00:05:46.805
I need to speak with you.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.015
Say, Kumagoro,

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:52.811
what do you suppose they're
talking about? Does it bother you?

00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:55.188
Yeah, right? It bothers you, right?

00:05:55.397 --> 00:05:57.983
Let's go over and ask them.
Yeah, let's do that.

00:05:58.775 --> 00:06:00.235
You don't need to go over there!

00:06:00.318 --> 00:06:02.279
What? But...

00:06:02.612 --> 00:06:05.282
They seem to be having some
sort of serious discussion,

00:06:05.323 --> 00:06:06.533
so hang tight for now.

00:06:06.741 --> 00:06:07.868
Okay, Ryu?

00:06:10.912 --> 00:06:14.457
Hey, Ryuichil
Where the hell did you go?!

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.879
Did you forget the condition
| gave for writing your lyrics?

00:06:20.714 --> 00:06:22.215
I have not forgotten.

00:06:22.549 --> 00:06:26.011
"Make arrangements so that
Shuichi won't be hurt," right?

00:06:27.304 --> 00:06:30.682
Then, why did he go home?

00:06:31.016 --> 00:06:33.894
I don't know. I wonder why?

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.649
How many times are you going
to make me repeat myself?

00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:42.444
| told you that you wouldn't
regret it, remember?

00:06:42.861 --> 00:06:46.197
Now, everyone,
let's continue with the rehearsal.

00:06:46.865 --> 00:06:49.451
| see... Shuichi...

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:56.082
Hey, what the hell are you doing?!

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.083
Hey, hurry up and go!
Hey, what the hell are you doing?!

00:06:57.083 --> 00:06:57.417
Hey, hurry up and go!

00:06:57.459 --> 00:06:59.044
Hurry up and go already!

00:06:59.961 --> 00:07:03.340
Won't you... please go get him for us?

00:07:04.591 --> 00:07:06.927
It's not my style, huh?

00:07:07.969 --> 00:07:10.221
Hey, gimme a break already!

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:12.140
You're pissing me off!

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:16.227
That's impossible.

00:07:33.161 --> 00:07:35.330
A-At a time like this...

00:07:37.374 --> 00:07:39.542
I-It can't be...

00:07:45.548 --> 00:07:46.925
T-Tatsuha...

00:07:48.259 --> 00:07:49.427
Wh-What are you...

00:07:49.511 --> 00:07:53.056
I'm cursing you, bro.

00:07:54.015 --> 00:07:56.935
Wh-What are you talking about? Why?

00:07:57.268 --> 00:08:02.273
Because you supplied Nittle Grasper with lyrics.

00:08:02.732 --> 00:08:04.150
Without telling me!

00:08:06.277 --> 00:08:09.781
And you KNOW that the
great Ryuichi is my life!

00:08:11.658 --> 00:08:13.284
S-Stop it...

00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:16.079
Without even asking for my permission!

00:08:18.081 --> 00:08:19.749
Oh, I got a nail stuck in me.

00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:21.918
Quit this idiocy and get...

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.087
Not so fast, bro!

00:08:25.088 --> 00:08:27.132
Until you let me see the great Ryuichi,

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:29.300
I'm not budging, no matter what.

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:30.552
To me...

00:08:30.635 --> 00:08:32.053
...Ryuichi Sakuma...

00:08:32.262 --> 00:08:34.931
Ryuichi is Wonderful
...is like a god!

00:08:34.931 --> 00:08:35.724
Ryuichi is Wonderful

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:37.308
That background...

00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:40.603
It reminds me of that idiot.

00:08:41.271 --> 00:08:43.732
Ryuichi is Wonderful

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.234
In the end...
In the end, it's still true!

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.820
To me, Ryuichi Sakuma is like a god!

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:49.696
Big brother!
To me, Ryuichi Sakuma is like a god!

00:08:49.696 --> 00:08:50.447
Big brother!

00:08:52.365 --> 00:08:54.659
Th-This is huge, big brother!

00:08:54.826 --> 00:08:55.785
What's wrong?!

00:08:56.161 --> 00:08:58.621
Mr. Sakuma is outside!

00:08:58.872 --> 00:09:00.540
Wh-What did you say?!

00:09:06.713 --> 00:09:07.589
Mr. Sakuma!

00:09:08.006 --> 00:09:09.049
Mr. Sakuma!

00:09:12.093 --> 00:09:14.554
Hey there, Shuichi.

00:09:15.013 --> 00:09:17.098
Oh, it's really...

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:19.267
It's really Mr. Sakumal!

00:09:19.642 --> 00:09:21.478
Don't run over the cables!

00:09:22.145 --> 00:09:23.605
So, anyway...

00:09:27.317 --> 00:09:28.443
| see.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.904
Yuki came looking for me...

00:09:31.112 --> 00:09:31.988
Yeah.

00:09:32.113 --> 00:09:34.324
You want that song, right?

00:09:34.532 --> 00:09:36.785
I'll give it to you, so come back.

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:37.660
Mr. Sakuma.

00:09:37.702 --> 00:09:38.369
Hm?

00:09:46.628 --> 00:09:48.838
Kumagoro Beam!

00:09:53.176 --> 00:09:56.971
Mr. Sakuma, who's like a god to me,

00:09:57.514 --> 00:09:59.808
fired the Kumagoro Beam at me!

00:10:00.308 --> 00:10:02.185
I--- I---

00:10:02.477 --> 00:10:05.271
I could just die right now!

00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:11.111
Now, Shu, I'll give you that song,
so come back with me.

00:10:11.528 --> 00:10:14.489
If it's about that, it doesn't matter anymore.

00:10:14.531 --> 00:10:15.281
Huh?

00:10:15.365 --> 00:10:15.698
Nittle in Budoukan

00:10:15.698 --> 00:10:16.991
Nittle in Budoukan | was watching
the Nittle Grasper videos I'd collected...

00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:19.828
Nittle Grasper Summer Live | was watching
the Nittle Grasper videos I'd collected...

00:10:20.161 --> 00:10:23.498
...and it kind of helped me
sort out my feelings.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.667
Is this speech going to be long?

00:10:26.167 --> 00:10:28.461
A band that I've loved
since I was a little brat...

00:10:28.795 --> 00:10:31.047
...is going to sing a song
written by the person I love.

00:10:31.339 --> 00:10:34.551
Maybe that's a wonderful thing, after all.

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:39.848
Watching your old performances made
me come to think of it that way.

00:10:40.473 --> 00:10:45.103
Of course, to be honest, a part of me
is still a bit disappointed, but...

00:10:46.729 --> 00:10:47.522
But...

00:10:48.189 --> 00:10:49.482
I'm sorry.

00:10:49.899 --> 00:10:51.317
You've fallen asleep, haven't you?

00:10:53.862 --> 00:10:56.531
| wonder what Yuki's doing?

00:11:09.127 --> 00:11:11.504
Getting all weepy...
You're supposed to be a man.

00:11:11.588 --> 00:11:13.631
I haven't even done anything painful yet.

00:11:14.632 --> 00:11:16.634
You're a real strange one, you know that?

00:11:17.468 --> 00:11:21.431
If it's not money or sex,
just what do you want from me?

00:11:22.015 --> 00:11:24.100
I've got a lousy mouth
and a lousy personality.

00:11:24.184 --> 00:11:26.144
There's nothing good about me.

00:11:26.477 --> 00:11:28.479
You're satisfied just to be near me?

00:11:28.771 --> 00:11:32.692
Is that what you're going to say?
It sounds like a line from a novel.

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:36.946
Is that what love and romance
are supposed to be about?

00:11:36.988 --> 00:11:38.781
No, that's not what they're
supposed to be about.

00:11:38.823 --> 00:11:39.490
Wha?!

00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:43.244
Sleep-talking is a scary thing,
don't you agree, bro?

00:11:44.746 --> 00:11:46.664
| heard it ALL!

00:11:46.789 --> 00:11:49.918
"Is that what love and romance
are supposed to be about?"

00:11:51.085 --> 00:11:51.586
Huh?

00:11:52.378 --> 00:11:53.338
Hush money.

00:11:55.798 --> 00:12:00.053
A special ticket, only for those involved,
to the Tokyo Bay Music Fest.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:01.471
I've been waiting for this!

00:12:01.512 --> 00:12:03.139
It's a deal!

00:12:03.348 --> 00:12:05.141
Now the great Ryuichi is...

00:12:05.308 --> 00:12:08.603
Wait, are you sure you
don't have to show up, bro?

00:12:08.895 --> 00:12:11.064
You're technically a guest, after all.
If you don't go...

00:12:27.163 --> 00:12:30.166
The day of the Tokyo Bay
Music Fest is fast approaching!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.377
The world's top artists will
be gathering in Tokyo!

00:12:32.418 --> 00:12:35.463
Tickets are on sale and going
fast at your local Playland!

00:12:35.505 --> 00:12:37.882
One week left until the event, huh?

00:12:38.007 --> 00:12:41.469
| hear Nittle Grasper is
making steady progress.

00:12:41.511 --> 00:12:43.638
In comparison, our situation...

00:12:43.846 --> 00:12:46.683
That's it, I've reached my limit!

00:12:46.975 --> 00:12:49.477
Since it's come to this,
I'll drag Shuichi's butt back here,

00:12:49.477 --> 00:12:51.437
even if I have to put
a couple slugs in people!

00:12:52.021 --> 00:12:54.440
We got slugs put into us... Hey!
We got slugs put into us... Hey!

00:12:55.024 --> 00:13:00.238
Summoned and I pop out, ta-da!
Ge-Ge-Ge-German Suplex!

00:13:02.657 --> 00:13:03.866
Mr. Shindo!

00:13:04.909 --> 00:13:06.494
Shindo!

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.706
I-I don't need the German done on me.

00:13:10.707 --> 00:13:13.293
So, you've come back, Shuichi.

00:13:13.835 --> 00:13:17.588
You bet! Hiro, Shuichi Shindo's
made a full recovery!

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:19.674
Then, please get working
on those lyrics.

00:13:19.799 --> 00:13:21.217
We don't have any time left.

00:13:21.384 --> 00:13:23.636
Write it now! Write it right away! Right now!

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:26.514
Sure thing! Just leave it to me!

00:13:26.514 --> 00:13:26.764
All right!
Sure thing! Just leave it to me!

00:13:26.764 --> 00:13:27.724
All right!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:28.975
This is great!

00:13:56.711 --> 00:13:59.088
It's been... a week since then...

00:14:00.214 --> 00:14:02.884
Who would've thought
he'd still be in a slump?

00:14:02.967 --> 00:14:04.302
It's tomorrow, you know.

00:14:04.552 --> 00:14:06.596
If we don't have the
lyrics done by tomorrow,

00:14:06.596 --> 00:14:08.431
we won't be able to make up for it.

00:14:08.598 --> 00:14:11.392
Oh, we're done for!

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:13.394
If the release date gets postponed,

00:14:13.436 --> 00:14:17.774
who knows HOW I'll be reprimanded
by the president?!

00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:19.317
Here.

00:14:20.777 --> 00:14:21.819
What's this?

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:25.031
Shuichi, rather than
pushing yourself too much,

00:14:25.073 --> 00:14:26.783
how about we go for a change of scenery?

00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:31.204
Th-This is...

00:15:03.903 --> 00:15:05.446
Yuki's going to come here.

00:15:05.947 --> 00:15:07.031
What'll I do?

00:15:07.532 --> 00:15:10.618
| don't know how to face him.

00:15:10.743 --> 00:15:12.286
Hey, this is it. This is the spot.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.080
There we go.

00:15:16.249 --> 00:15:17.875
No! No! No!

00:15:17.959 --> 00:15:20.503
That's Yuki's! That's Yuki's seat!

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:22.505
No! It's my seat!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:26.050
It's my seat for me to share a
lovely gaze with Mr. Sakumal

00:15:26.384 --> 00:15:28.094
Don't lie!

00:15:30.972 --> 00:15:32.056
It's not a lie.

00:15:32.974 --> 00:15:35.560
My bro gave me his ticket.

00:15:36.185 --> 00:15:37.311
Bro's not coming.

00:15:37.478 --> 00:15:38.271
What?

00:15:40.481 --> 00:15:42.692
What?!

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:45.153
Don't give me this crap!

00:15:48.531 --> 00:15:50.158
I-It can't be...

00:15:50.867 --> 00:15:54.745
Yuki isn't... Yuki isn't coming?

00:16:01.669 --> 00:16:02.712
He's...

00:16:05.047 --> 00:16:08.509
...still got zero talent when
it comes to writing lyrics.

00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:17.351
Sorry, I've got a date the day
after tomorrow. Besides...

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:18.978
Besides?

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:22.273
During that concert, you're planning on
sticking music to those garbage lyrics...

00:16:22.273 --> 00:16:24.150
...and singing that, right?

00:16:26.194 --> 00:16:29.030
With a pro like me pointing
out your lack of talent,

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:30.781
you've got no choice
but to acknowledge it.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.452
In which case, you mean to recover
your honor with your singing, right?

00:16:34.744 --> 00:16:38.498
You really are an endlessly simpleminded
idiot who's easy to figure out.

00:16:39.957 --> 00:16:42.126
Oh, I suppose I am all that.

00:16:42.668 --> 00:16:44.462
You're quite an interesting character.

00:16:45.087 --> 00:16:46.255
I like you.

00:16:47.131 --> 00:16:49.800
If you really want me to, I won't
mind attending your concert.

00:16:50.134 --> 00:16:50.968
What?!

00:16:51.844 --> 00:16:53.387
Even if they're both stupid,

00:16:53.387 --> 00:16:56.140
I suppose it'll be better
than a woman's idle gossip.

00:16:58.726 --> 00:16:59.644
It's okay.

00:17:00.311 --> 00:17:01.270
Don't come.

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:03.898
Go on the date with that woman.

00:17:04.315 --> 00:17:05.942
She's your lover, right?

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.235
It's not like...

00:17:07.568 --> 00:17:10.112
...whether you come or not
will change the fact...

00:17:10.488 --> 00:17:12.031
...that I'm doing fine.

00:17:13.074 --> 00:17:15.868
So... don't come!

00:17:44.981 --> 00:17:46.440
The dimension of the panorama...
shikai o nukedashita

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.650
...that has slipped out of sight
panorama no dimension

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:50.528
The perfect camouflage simply trembles
kanpeki na gitai wa tada furueru

00:17:50.611 --> 00:17:51.904
The reaction of cheap feelers...
cheap na shokushu wa

00:17:51.904 --> 00:17:53.281
...seeking out secrets
mitsu o motomeru reaction

00:17:53.281 --> 00:17:56.158
You're cold but indecent and I want to see you
tsumetakutemo hiwai na kimi ga mitai

00:17:56.284 --> 00:17:58.953
The floating sea of pleasure...
nanairo ni moteasobu

00:17:58.953 --> 00:18:01.747
...that toys with me in a rainbow of colors
ukidashita kairaku no umi

00:18:01.872 --> 00:18:04.500
A game hemmed by shadows,
kage ga fuchidoru game

00:18:04.542 --> 00:18:08.504
punch it out of this world
kono sekai kara uchinuke

00:18:08.588 --> 00:18:10.381
Kiss Shining,

00:18:10.381 --> 00:18:13.676
shaping solitude
kodoku o katachidori

00:18:13.843 --> 00:18:19.307
The entangling remorse slices through the void
karamaru koukai ga kuu o kiru

00:18:19.557 --> 00:18:21.601
Make Me Shining,

00:18:21.642 --> 00:18:24.854
the shards of the heart that scatter
chirabaru kokoro no kakera

00:18:25.146 --> 00:18:31.652
In the hope that passes by blindingly
mabushiku sugisaru kibou ni

00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:35.114
These lyrics...

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:36.699
These lyrics...

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.492
...are about me.

00:18:39.869 --> 00:18:41.412
They're singing about me!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.123
Shuichi!

00:18:44.832 --> 00:18:46.792
Come on, Shuichi!

00:18:47.168 --> 00:18:49.712
You sing with me, too!

00:18:50.087 --> 00:18:50.755
What?

00:19:00.431 --> 00:19:02.933
If he does something like this on
the great stage of the world...

00:19:02.975 --> 00:19:04.352
If he does something like this...

00:19:04.393 --> 00:19:06.228
You'll pass out, of course.

00:19:06.395 --> 00:19:08.189
Kiss Shining,

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:11.651
pressing lips to your gaze
hitomi ni kuchizukete

00:19:11.776 --> 00:19:14.987
Even the flower petals beginning to melt
tokedasu hanabira

00:19:15.029 --> 00:19:17.365
get in the way
mo jama ni naru

00:19:17.406 --> 00:19:19.492
Kill Me Shining,

00:19:19.533 --> 00:19:22.912
at the ends of the colored thrills
iro-zuku shigeki no hate ni

00:19:22.953 --> 00:19:28.542
There is an apparition that has begun to shine
kagayaki-hajimeta maboroshi

00:19:28.668 --> 00:19:30.711
Please Don't Cr yin',

00:19:30.753 --> 00:19:34.131
shaping solitude
kodoku o katachidori

00:19:34.215 --> 00:19:39.762
The entangling remorse slices through the void
karamaru koukai ga kuu o kiru

00:19:39.887 --> 00:19:41.972
Make Me Shining,

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:45.476
the shards of the heart that scatter
