00:20:59.216 --> 00:21:01.969
Are you really sure we don't
need to cut to a commercial?

00:21:02.011 --> 00:21:03.971
I-I guess we could cut away soon...

00:21:04.513 --> 00:21:05.765
Wait, what?!

00:21:07.516 --> 00:21:10.519
Actually, I've been in a slump
for quite a while now.

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:14.315
But having sang that song
just now, I realized...

00:21:14.815 --> 00:21:19.528
...that all I had to do was relax, and honestly
sing what was going through my mind.

00:21:20.488 --> 00:21:22.239
Hiro! Fujisaki!

00:21:22.615 --> 00:21:23.657
Come up here!

00:21:24.575 --> 00:21:28.996
Oh, w-w-w-w-wait!
If you guys go up there, I...

00:21:29.872 --> 00:21:31.582
You'll pass out again.

00:21:31.832 --> 00:21:33.709
Mr. Shindo!

00:21:34.126 --> 00:21:39.256
I... feel like I can put
lyrics to that music now!

00:21:39.423 --> 00:21:43.636
| can't take it... I can't take
responsibility for this anymore.

00:21:43.677 --> 00:21:45.513
| will take responsibility.

00:21:45.846 --> 00:21:46.472
What?
Oh?

00:21:48.724 --> 00:21:50.434
M-Mr. President...

00:21:55.147 --> 00:21:58.317
Those Bad Luck guys are jumping
in on the world's stage?!

00:21:58.359 --> 00:22:00.152
Keep the cameras rolling!

00:22:00.319 --> 00:22:01.946
| know that!

00:22:36.105 --> 00:22:40.568
When an orange moonlit night comes along
orenji-iro tsukiyo ga kuru to

00:22:41.652 --> 00:22:45.781
It reminds me of you
kimi no koto o omoidasu

00:22:47.157 --> 00:22:51.579
My cool, affected lines
kakko tsuketa ore no serif u wa

00:22:51.954 --> 00:22:55.875
Are lines that belong to someone else
hoka no dareka no serif u de

00:22:56.458 --> 00:23:02.673
I suddenly look up to see a silhouette
fui ni miageru silhouette

00:23:02.965 --> 00:23:08.429
The light that lit your profile
kimi no yokogao o terashita

00:23:08.929 --> 00:23:15.102
Even now, that pale light
awai hikari wa ima de mo

00:23:17.146 --> 00:23:22.359
For what am I waiting?
nani o matteru

00:23:22.651 --> 00:23:27.781
The room empty of you
kimi wa inai heya

00:23:28.198 --> 00:23:36.081
Time alone echoes in my sleepless heart
toki dake ga ashioto no you ni nemurenai

00:23:36.165 --> 00:23:38.751
like footsteps
mune ni hibiku

00:23:39.209 --> 00:23:44.423
Even now, I'm waiting
ima mo matteru

00:23:44.715 --> 00:23:49.887
Alone, I'm stopped still
hitori tomatteru

00:23:50.262 --> 00:23:55.392
That moon we saw together that day,
futari mita ano hi no tsuki o

00:23:55.434 --> 00:24:03.025
where are you seeing it from now?
Ima doko de kimi wa miteru

00:24:20.626 --> 00:24:25.798
Even now, I'm waiting
ima mo matteru

00:24:26.090 --> 00:24:31.303
Alone, I'm stopped still
hitori tomatteru

00:24:31.637 --> 00:24:36.767
That moon we saw together that day,
futari mita ano hi no tsuki o

00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:42.773
where are you seeing it from now?
Ima doko de kimi wa miteru

00:25:05.379 --> 00:25:07.881
This is a song they just wrote on the spot?

00:25:08.424 --> 00:25:09.758
Brings tears to your eyes, doesn't it?

00:25:10.092 --> 00:25:12.094
Good going, Shuichi.

00:25:12.344 --> 00:25:14.888
Shu, that was awesome!

00:25:15.597 --> 00:25:18.517
It seems he has grown from
this experience as well.

00:25:18.767 --> 00:25:19.810
You think so?

00:25:21.687 --> 00:25:24.648
He's just as bad with lyrics as ever, though.

00:25:25.024 --> 00:25:27.568
This broadcast is being sent out to the world...

00:25:27.609 --> 00:25:32.531
| can't wait to see how the world
market will take to Bad Luck.

00:25:34.783 --> 00:25:36.076
So that's it.

00:25:37.119 --> 00:25:39.204
It's not just about the promotion, you know.

00:25:39.747 --> 00:25:43.584
With this, Shindo has also escaped his slump...

00:25:44.001 --> 00:25:45.836
...and the song you gave us...

00:25:45.919 --> 00:25:49.548
...can now also be released in two
versions, ours and Bad Luck's.

00:25:49.715 --> 00:25:51.633
To the big market that is the world.

00:25:52.259 --> 00:25:54.386
So, it all went according to plan.

00:25:54.803 --> 00:25:58.557
| told you, didn't I?
That you wouldn't regret it.

00:26:03.312 --> 00:26:04.438
So, they're Bad Luck.

00:26:05.064 --> 00:26:07.816
What do you think? Do you like them?

00:26:08.442 --> 00:26:10.986
They're an interesting band. They have
a power that draws people to them...

00:26:11.153 --> 00:26:14.406
What should this mysterious
power be called?

00:26:15.657 --> 00:26:17.534
It's Gravitation...

00:26:18.243 --> 00:26:22.998
Oh! Oh! Smashing Blue! Oh! Oh!

00:26:38.472 --> 00:26:42.768
At the rain trickling down my body
karada o tsutau ame ni

00:26:45.437 --> 00:26:49.566
A fleeting emotion trembles
furueru awai omoi

00:26:52.402 --> 00:26:56.573
At the blazing red temptation
guren no yuuwaku ni

00:26:59.243 --> 00:27:03.747
the wandering night ends in dawn
samayou yoru ga akeru

00:27:07.376 --> 00:27:14.174
The smashing blue that colors the brilliant miracle
mabushii kiseki o irodoru smashing blue

00:27:14.341 --> 00:27:17.427
It starts, make me true
hajimaru make me true

00:27:17.761 --> 00:27:21.682
The vanishing moon is silent
kieyuku tsuki wa silent

00:27:21.723 --> 00:27:28.063
The smashing blue has no need of even your voice
kimi no koe mo iranai smashing blue

00:27:28.188 --> 00:27:31.567
The glimmer lingering
suhada ni nokoru

00:27:31.692 --> 00:27:36.405
on your bare skin is like twilight
kirameki marude twilight

00:27:36.530 --> 00:27:41.326
Oh! Oh! Smashing Blue! Oh! Oh!

00:28:02.556 --> 00:28:03.891
Not too bad, I suppose.

00:28:04.474 --> 00:28:05.601
Yuki...

00:28:06.310 --> 00:28:09.188
Welcome home, Shuichi.

00:28:10.314 --> 00:28:11.231
Yuki.

00:28:12.149 --> 00:28:13.317
You were awake?

00:28:13.525 --> 00:28:14.943
Yuki, hold me.

00:28:14.985 --> 00:28:16.320
I'm not holding you, stupid.

00:28:16.445 --> 00:28:18.447
Come on, hold me.

00:28:18.530 --> 00:28:19.781
Man, what a pain.

00:28:20.115 --> 00:28:22.826
If you want me to hold you that much,
we're taking it to bed.

00:28:23.035 --> 00:28:25.579
No, that wasn't what I meant.

00:28:25.746 --> 00:28:26.747
You don't want to?

00:28:27.497 --> 00:28:30.709
It's not... that I... don't want to...
